                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hi , \ni would like to start with , why the hell this game has such negative reviews ? Honestly for the price = quality of the game it is truly under-priced , i have seen so many indie titles that are not even close to Tears of Avia with double the price tag. \n\nThe game what you can typically expect in a tactical rpg - there is nothing too special about the game, but also it does what the it promises pretty good. could use more customization options and more content, however the game is still pretty enjoyable, art and graphics are well made , voice acting is .. enjoyable, low production all in all, but you get what you are paying for and little more. \n\n",
